So:
- `loadReviewActionHarness` (CC 50): all the mock object methods (function expressions) aggregate into it. Fix: hoist mock builders into **named top-level function declarations** — each becomes its own entry. But then each builder function's CC = 1 + own branches + nested lambdas within it. E.g. a `gh926ScmMock(opts, rec)` named function containing the scm object literal with 12 methods: CC = sum ≈ 20. Still > 8!

So each named builder must be small: group ~3-4 simple methods per builder, or reduce branches. CC budget ≤ 8 per named function (at ~100% coverage CRAP = CC; at 87% cov CRAP = CC²·0.002 + CC ≈ CC + small).

