Sum = 19. Split into 3 builders (CC counts: 1 + nested):
- A: listPrs(2)+getRemoteRepoInfo(2)+addLabel(1)+removeLabel(1) = 1+6=7 ✓
- B: addComment(1)+addInlineComment(1)+resolveThread(2)+getPrDiff(3) = 1+7=8 ✗ → 8 needs cov 100%. Rearrange: B: addComment+addInlineComment+resolveThread+fetchDiscussions = 1+1+1+2+2=7 ✓; C: getPrDiff(3)+submitReview(1)+listReviews(2)+dismissReview(1) = 1+7=8 ✗. Hmm: C: getPrDiff+submitReview = 1+3+1=5; D: listReviews+dismissReview+fetchDiscussions = 1+2+1+2=6.

