1. `loadReviewActionHarness` — CC 50, cov 86.9% → 55.6. To get ≤ 8: CC²(1-cov)³+CC ≤ 8 → for CC 50 even cov 100% gives CRAP 50! CC alone > 8 → impossible without splitting. Must decompose (lower CC) OR get measured differently. Actually if cov=100%, CRAP = CC. So CC must be ≤ 8 at 100% cov, or lower CC with less coverage. This harness is a giant mock factory of CC 50. Need to split it into helper functions: makeScmMock, makeAutoStartMock, makeOutputFilesMock, makeGlobalMocks, etc. Each small.

2. `makeResumeHarness` — CC 12, cov 72.2% → 15.1. Need to split or fully cover. With CC 12: even 100% cov gives 12 > 8. So must split (or restructure) to CC ≤ 8.

